R 标题，此变更聚焦于修复 matmul reduce scatter 算子中 bias 偏移量计算的错误。\n\n#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 mmrs（matmul reduce scatter）算子中 `bias` 偏移计算的问题。在 `matmul_reduce_scatter_aiv_mode_dequant.h` 和 `matmul_reduce_scatter_aiv_mode_smallM.h` 两个 kernel 文件中，调整了 Epilogue 阶段 `gmBiasOffset` 指针的计算逻辑，确保 bias 向量能够正确对齐到对应分块的实际列偏移位置，避免因偏移量计算错误导致 bias 加法结果异常。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **Bias 指针偏移修复（dequant 模式）**: 在 `matmul_reduce_scatter_aiv_mode_dequant.h` 的 `DequantRunner::RunMatmulReduceScatter` 中，修正了 `gmBiasOffset` 的计算方式，使其基于 `blockLocCoord` 准确定位到当前分块对应的 bias 列起始地址。\n\n- **Bias 指针偏移修复（smallM 模式）**: 在 `matmul_reduce_scatter_aiv_mode_smallM.h` 的 `CompleteRemoteDataCopy` 中，同步修正了 `gmBiasOffset` 的计算，配合分块通信切分逻辑（`comm_blockLocCoord`），确保在 smallM 场景下 bias 偏移同样正确。\n\n- **PerTokenScale 索引调整（smallM 模式）**: 在 smallM 模式的 Epilogue 调用中，对 `perTokenScale` 的索引偏移计算进行了调整，使其与分块实际起始行位置保持一致。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-24T11:05:32+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-24T11:05:32+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176859789,"discussion_id":"1b689f1a1758bac0885a090987305af005b67251","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-06-24T11:28:41+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-24T11:28:41+08:00","user":{"id":"6879c0b1ba419813105852d3","login":"yangzeheng","object_id":"6879c0b1ba419813105852d3","name":"yangzeheng","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yangzeheng"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":176861495,"discussion_id":"3203f6a57edd981c1cd6a5dd430ea2ccd1ea2ca3","body":"/lgtm","created_at":"2026-06-24T11:33:57+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-24T11:33:57+08:00","user":{"id":"680a0031c6be6f6a0f719f68","login":"captainmiaow","object_id":"680a0031c6be6f6a0f719f68","name":"captainmiaow","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/captainmiaow"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"}]